  "content": {
    "text": "LIVE\nUpdated 44 min ago\nStocks to Watch: Intel, Accenture, Micron, SpaceX\n↗️ Intel (INTC): Shares in the tech giant surged after President Trump said Apple agreed to work with it to design and build chips in the U.S.\n↘️ Accenture (ACN): Shares in the consultancy and IT-services provider tumbled after it cut its guidance; other software stocks are also down. Separately, Accenture announced deals of some $4 billion in the industrial-cybersecurity sector.\n↗️ Apple (AAPL): The iPhone maker plans to raise prices on its products to offset surging memory and storage-chip costs, CEO Tim Cook told the Journal. Apple's stock ticked higher, while shares in memory makers including Western Digital (WDC), Marvell Technology (MRVL) and Micron Technology (MU) climbed.",
